# Code ownership for this repository is enforced by the
# "Request external review" workflow, not by native CODEOWNERS rules:
# pull requests from outside contributors are routed to @preddy4690
# (the sanctioned corporate maintainer), while pull requests from
# organization members and collaborators do not generate a review
# request. Native CODEOWNERS cannot tell the two apart, so no
# ownership rules are declared here on purpose.
#
# See .github/workflows/request-external-review.yml.
#
# If branch protection ever starts requiring review from code owners,
# reintroduce explicit rules here — the workflow only requests reviews,
# it does not gate merges.
